=== Bazaar ===
The {{Ench|Crop Fever}} [[Enchantment]] can be traded through the [[Bazaar]].
{{EnchantmentBazaarStats|id=ENCHANTMENT_ULTIMATE_CROP_FEVER|name=Crop Fever|minimum=1|maximum=5}}

== Ability ==
While breaking crops, the player has a {{Green|0.001%}} chance per level to trigger a '''{{LightPurple|Crop Fever}}''', which lasts for {{Green|60}} seconds. During a '''{{LightPurple|Crop Fever}}''', the player gains {{stat|fmf|+100}}, {{Stat|bloom|15}}, and each crop broken has a chance to grant additional crops.

