== Bugs ==
* '''Crop Fever''' procs twice on {{Item|Sugar Cane}} and {{Item|Cactus}} due to them being two block tall crops.{{confirm|is this still true? it might've been fixed. If it's intended this category should be renamed from 'Bugs' to 'Notes'}}

== Trivia ==
* While under the effect of a '''Crop Fever''', the player's {{Stat|hp}}, {{Stat|def}}, and {{Stat|mana}} displays alternate between rainbow colors, and a unique soundtrack plays if the player has Hypixel music enabled.
** Like many other Hypixel soundtracks, it was made by ShinkoNet.<ref>https://x.com/ShinkoNetCavy/status/2021417837424947261</ref>
* '''{{Pink|Crop Fever}}'''{{'}}s ability works similarly to how {{Item|Pumpkin Dicer}} and {{Item|Melon Dicer}}'s abilities worked before the update that released it.
* Upon release, '''{{Pink|Crop Fever}}''' was dropping {{Item|Enchanted Hay Bale|amount=120}} for the '''{{DarkPurple|PRAY TO RNGESUS}}''' drop for [[Wheat]], which is worth {{Item|Wheat|amount=3072000}}, or {{c|18432000}} to [[Shops|NPC]]. This was later patched and became {{Item|Enchanted Hay Bale|amount=12}} instead.
** The mistake likely came from the fact that the '''{{Pink|CRAZY RARE}}''' drop is {{Item|Enchanted Wheat|amount=120}}.
* '''{{Pink|Crop Fever}}''' can be activated from breaking [[Mutations]] in the [[Greenhouse]].

